        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Zohra Lampert, Natalie Wood, Warren Beatty, Elia Kazan\n- Works: Splendor in the Grass\n- Topics: Film casting, Film direction\n\nFacts:\n- In 1961, Zohra Lampert starred alongside Natalie Wood and Warren Beatty in the film Splendor in the Grass.\n- Splendor in the Grass was directed by Elia Kazan.\n- Elia Kazan was a Greek-American director.\n- The New York Times described Elia Kazan as \"one of the most honored and influential directors in Broadway and Hollywood history.\"",
